# Project Report: D&C MediaHouse Portfolio Website

## 1. Project Overview
**Project Name:** D&C MediaHouse
**Live Site URL:** [https://www.dcmediahouse.in/](https://www.dcmediahouse.in/)
**Description:** A high-end cinematic portfolio website tailored for D&C MediaHouse. The project focuses on delivering an immersive viewing experience, featuring adaptive video streaming (HLS) and modern, fluid animations to showcase media projects effectively.

